<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>智能新闻| smithsonianmag.com</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/rss/smart-news/</link><description>智能新闻的 RSS 提要</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 13:39:43 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>这位美国飞行员在二战期间击落了 40 架敌机。研究人员在太平洋丛林中发现了他的飞机残骸，并将机翼带回了他的家乡</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-american-pilot-downed-4o-enemy-aircraft-during-world-war-ii-researchers-discovered-the-wreck-of-his-plane-in-a-pacific-jungle-and-brought-a-wing-back-to-his-home-state-180989259/</link><description>理查德·邦格 (Richard I. Bong) 驾驶着一架装饰着他未来妻子玛姬 (Marge) 肖像的飞机，成为美国得分最高的“王牌”，并获得了荣誉勋章</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 20:33:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-american-pilot-downed-4o-enemy-aircraft-during-world-war-ii-researchers-discovered-the-wreck-of-his-plane-in-a-pacific-jungle-and-brought-a-wing-back-to-his-home-state-180989259/</guid></item><item><title>两人感染环孢子虫病后死亡，这是与持续的多州疫情相关的首例已知死亡事件</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/two-peope-died-after-getting-sick-with-cyclosporiasis-marking-the-first-known-deaths-linked-to-the-ongoing-multi-state-outbreak-180989256/</link><description>据州官员称，这两名患者都在密歇根州，都有潜在的健康问题。寄生虫引起的感染通常不会危及生命</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 19:17:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/two-peope-died-after-getting-sick-with-cyclosporiasis-marking-the-first-known-deaths-linked-to-the-ongoing-multi-state-outbreak-180989256/</guid></item><item><title>多瑙河水位已降至历史最低水平，河道中的纳粹战舰、炸弹和猛犸象骨头都显露出来</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-danube-river-has-fallen-to-record-low-water-levels-revealing-nazi-warships-bombs-and-woolly-mammoth-bones-in-its-channel-180989255/</link><description>随着欧洲第二长河流干涸，居民和研究人员正在寻找过去的历史和史前遗迹</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 18:20:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-danube-river-has-fallen-to-record-low-water-levels-revealing-nazi-warships-bombs-and-woolly-mammoth-bones-in-its-channel-180989255/</guid></item><item><title>天文学家可能首次发现了一个徘徊到银河系边缘的超大质量黑洞</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/in-a-first-astronomers-may-have-spotted-a-supermassive-black-hole-that-wandered-to-the-edge-of-its-galaxy-180989233/</link><description>这些巨大的天体大部分是在星系中心被发现的，也就是它们所居住的地方。但最近发现的一个——由于它吞噬恒星时发出的光而被发现——似乎距离其宿主星系的中心超过 30,000 光年</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 16:16:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/in-a-first-astronomers-may-have-spotted-a-supermassive-black-hole-that-wandered-to-the-edge-of-its-galaxy-180989233/</guid></item><item><title>这些早期的双翼飞机记录了北极，拍摄了新闻短片并见证了林德伯格的历史性飞行。现在，一个罕见的例子将悬挂在博物馆中</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/these-early-biplanes-documented-the-arctic-captured-newsreel-footage-and-witnessed-lindberghs-historic-flight-now-a-rare-example-will-hang-in-a-museum-180989253/</link><description>航空摇篮博物馆最近购买了一架柯蒂斯金莺 (Curtiss Oriole)，这是在附近花园城工厂制造的三座双翼飞机</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 15:17:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/these-early-biplanes-documented-the-arctic-captured-newsreel-footage-and-witnessed-lindberghs-historic-flight-now-a-rare-example-will-hang-in-a-museum-180989253/</guid></item><item><title>古代北美哺乳动物可能在墨西哥聚集并在迁徙到南美洲之前实现多样化，从而促进它们在那里繁衍生息</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/ancient-north-american-mammals-may-have-gathered-in-mexico-and-diversified-before-moving-to-south-america-priming-them-to-thrive-there-180989251/</link><description>对来自该国的化石进行的分析表明，七百万至一千万年前，来自北方的动物生活在“围栏”中。这个时间线可能有助于解释为什么如此多的南美哺乳动物有北美血统，但反之则不然</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/ancient-north-american-mammals-may-have-gathered-in-mexico-and-diversified-before-moving-to-south-america-priming-them-to-thrive-there-180989251/</guid></item><item><title>为了找回被纳粹掠夺的艺术品，研究人员正在发挥创意，采取新策略，包括人工智能聊天机器人和“通缉”海报活动</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/to-recover-artworks-looted-by-the-nazis-researchers-are-getting-creative-with-new-strategies-including-an-ai-chatbot-and-a-campaign-of-wanted-posters-180989247/</link><description>大学研究人员希望他们的新人工智能聊天机器人使来源研究变得更容易、更容易</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 21:33:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/to-recover-artworks-looted-by-the-nazis-researchers-are-getting-creative-with-new-strategies-including-an-ai-chatbot-and-a-campaign-of-wanted-posters-180989247/</guid></item><item><title>新图像提供了迄今为止最好的证据，证明超巨星参宿四确实有一个长期理论化的恒星伴星</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/new-images-provide-the-best-evidence-yet-that-supergiant-star-betelgeuse-does-inded-have-a-long-theorized-stellar-companion-180989225/</link><description>研究团队对这些数据基本信服，但他们希望在 2027 年捕获更多观察结果以证实他们的发现</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 20:07:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/new-images-provide-the-best-evidence-yet-that-supergiant-star-betelgeuse-does-inded-have-a-long-theorized-stellar-companion-180989225/</guid></item><item><title>这座拥有 400 年历史、坚不可摧的日本城堡在武士围攻中幸存下来，刚刚在地震中倒塌</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-400-year-old-impenetrable-japanese-castle-that-survived-a-samurai-siege-just-crumbled-in-an-earthquake-180989248/</link><description>1877年，一支反抗明治天皇的军队袭击了日本南部九州岛的熊本城</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 19:55:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-400-year-old-impenetrable-japanese-castle-that-survived-a-samurai-siege-just-crumbled-in-an-earthquake-180989248/</guid></item><item><title>一名男子将这件内战文物用作办公桌上的镇纸。拆弹小组告诉他这实际上是一枚实弹</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-man-used-this-civil-war-artifact-as-a-paperweight-on-his-desk-the-bomb-squad-told-him-it-was-actually-a-live-explosive-180989245/</link><description>该装置原来是 1800 年代中期为帕罗特步枪设计的炮弹。专家在圣安东尼奥附近的射击场安全引爆了它</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 19:40:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-man-used-this-civil-war-artifact-as-a-paperweight-on-his-desk-the-bomb-squad-told-him-it-was-actually-a-live-explosive-180989245/</guid></item><item><title>一名患有罕见遗传疾病的青少年在接受定制实验药物后首次独立行走</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/after-receiving-a-custom-experimental-medicine-a-teen-with-a-rare-genetic-disorder-walked-on-his-own-for-the-first-time-180989230/</link><description>患者的遗传性疾病导致频繁癫痫发作和发育迟缓。他的进步以及另一个接受类似个性化治疗的男孩的进步凸显了定制药物的前景和挑战</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 17:31:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/after-receiving-a-custom-experimental-medicine-a-teen-with-a-rare-genetic-disorder-walked-on-his-own-for-the-first-time-180989230/</guid></item><item><title>智利发现的木乃伊中隐藏了数百年的天花 DNA 表明欧洲殖民者将这种病毒带到了美洲</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/smallpox-dna-hidden-for-centuries-in-mummies-found-in-chile-suggests-european-colonists-brought-the-virus-to-the-americas-180989244/</link><description>研究人员表示，他们发现了病毒致命轨迹的第一个直接分子证据</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 15:27:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/smallpox-dna-hidden-for-centuries-in-mummies-found-in-chile-suggests-european-colonists-brought-the-virus-to-the-americas-180989244/</guid></item><item><title>这个人把人类尸体变成了受欢迎的博物馆展品。现在，这些有争议的“身体世界”的创造者将自己的身体捐赠给了科学</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-man-turned-human-corpses-into-popular-museum-displays-now-the-creator-of-these-controversial-body-worlds-has-donated-his-own-body-to-science-180989242/</link><description>冈瑟·冯·哈根斯 (Gunther von Hagens) 发明了塑化术，这是一种通过用聚合物代替天然液体来保存尸体的方法，最近去世，享年 81 岁</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 19:56:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-man-turned-human-corpses-into-popular-museum-displays-now-the-creator-of-these-controversial-body-worlds-has-donated-his-own-body-to-science-180989242/</guid></item><item><title>稀有化石揭示了及时冻结的三层食物链：翼龙被鱼龙吃掉，上龙又被吃掉</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/rare-fossil-reveals-a-three-tier-food-chain-frozen-in-time-a-pterosaur-eaten-by-an-ichthyosaur-eaten-by-a-pliosaur-180989243/</link><description>该化石由澳大利亚业余化石猎人部分发现，保留了史前捕食动态的独特面貌</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 18:40:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/rare-fossil-reveals-a-three-tier-food-chain-frozen-in-time-a-pterosaur-eaten-by-an-ichthyosaur-eaten-by-a-pliosaur-180989243/</guid></item><item><title>在 2028 年夏季奥运会之前，洛杉矶标志性的瓦茨塔将获得 2200 万美元的校园扩建</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-iconic-watts-towers-in-los-angeles-will-get-a-22-million-campus-expansion-ahead-of-the-2028-summer-olympics-180989240/</link><description>占地 5 英亩的绿地将环绕这座由 17 栋建筑组成的地标建筑，这是一位意大利移民花费三十年时间建造的民间艺术杰作</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 18:05:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-iconic-watts-towers-in-los-angeles-will-get-a-22-million-campus-expansion-ahead-of-the-2028-summer-olympics-180989240/</guid></item><item><title>考古学家发现两座缩略图大小的鸟类雕塑，由 4 万年前的猛犸象牙雕刻而成</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-discover-two-thumbnail-sized-bird-sculptures-carved-from-mammoth-ivory-40000-years-ago-180989239/</link><description>这些雕像长不到一英寸，埋在德国霍勒费尔斯洞穴下方，那里发现了一些世界上最古老的已知雕像艺术品</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 18:01:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-discover-two-thumbnail-sized-bird-sculptures-carved-from-mammoth-ivory-40000-years-ago-180989239/</guid></item><item><title>古代DNA表明，冰河时代的人类大多杀死了雌性猛犸象</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/ice-age-humans-mostly-killed-female-woolly-mammoths-suggests-ancient-dna-180989241/</link><description>在分析了 500 多块猛犸象骨骼后，研究人员发现，古代人类过度捕猎雌性猛犸象，原因尚不清楚</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 17:41:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/ice-age-humans-mostly-killed-female-woolly-mammoths-suggests-ancient-dna-180989241/</guid></item><item><title>南极内部气温降至零下 119.4 华氏度，这是十多年来地球有记录以来的最低温度</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/antarctic-interior-hits-119-4-degrees-fahrenheit-earths-lowest-recorded-temperature-in-more-than-a-decade-180989231/</link><description>康科迪亚研究站创纪录的寒冷发生在几周前，最南端大陆的另一个地区经历了相反的极端情况，冬季气温攀升至前所未有的高位</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/antarctic-interior-hits-119-4-degrees-fahrenheit-earths-lowest-recorded-temperature-in-more-than-a-decade-180989231/</guid></item><item><title>隐藏在亚马逊树冠下的神秘形状揭示了一个庞大的古代文明，其规模比研究人员预期的要大得多</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/mysterious-shapes-hidden-beneath-the-amazon-canopy-reveal-a-sprawling-ancient-civilization-much-bigger-than-researchers-expected-180989236/</link><description>科学家最近在巴西北部发现了数百个来自阿奎里文明的巨大几何土方工程，被称为“地画”</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 13:47:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/mysterious-shapes-hidden-beneath-the-amazon-canopy-reveal-a-sprawling-ancient-civilization-much-bigger-than-researchers-expected-180989236/</guid></item><item><title>音频工程师在先锋“蓝调之母”的新歌曲宝库中恢复了隐藏的音符并揭示了丢失的乐器</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/audio-engineers-restored-hidden-notes-and-revealed-lost-instruments-in-this-new-treasure-trove-of-songs-by-the-pioneering-mother-of-the-blues-180989228/</link><description>该专辑收录了 118 首曲目，是美国蓝调偶像 Ma Rainey 录制的最完整的一套唱片</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 20:14:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/audio-engineers-restored-hidden-notes-and-revealed-lost-instruments-in-this-new-treasure-trove-of-songs-by-the-pioneering-mother-of-the-blues-180989228/</guid></item></channel></rss>